title Fishing Extravaganza (Completionist)
faction Horde
category Miscellaneous
levels 1-60
zone Orgrimmar
pitch The quests of Fishing Extravaganza, as far as the reference data places them.

step About this guide
  note Each quest here is offered only while the event runs. Every step is optional: do what the calendar offers now, and come back for the rest.

step Could I get a Fishing Flier?
  when skill Fishing 150
  tip A repeatable quest: hand it in once, with what it asks for.
  zone map 1454
  turnin 8228 direct optional

